/* CREATEPROCESS_MANIFEST_RESOURCE_ID (1) and RT_MANIFEST (24).
   The GNU toolchain embeds the manifest through this resource script; MSVC uses the
   linker's /MANIFESTDEPENDENCY instead and never reads this file. Both paths live in
   build.rs, which is where the full rationale is written.

   Keep this file pure ASCII: windres hands it to the C preprocessor, whose input
   charset depends on the build environment, and a failure here fails the release build
   outright (build.rs panics rather than ship a binary without the manifest).
   Enforced by scripts/testing/windows-script-encoding.mjs. */
1 24 "app.manifest"
